  "historyNote": "#1547, eff 3-13-80; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; amd by #5611, eff 4-13-93; ss by #6316, eff 8-13-96; amd by #6944, eff 2-24-99; ss by #7460, eff 3-15-01; ss by #7890, eff 5-19-03; ss by #8131, eff 8-13-04; amd by #8634, eff 5-23-06; ss by #9219, eff 9-1-08; ss by 10875, eff 7-8-15; ss by #14332, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
